{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JollyRoll is a cozy reimagining of classic marble-matching games, filled with nostalgic charm.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, relax, and watch colorful marbles roll as you line up the perfect shot, chain together combos, and rediscover the simple joy of breaking marbles one satisfying match at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/f3c9561752f5bdb6b929b11d1e13b523.poster.avif?t=1757688021\" width=256 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/f3c9561752f5bdb6b929b11d1e13b523.webm?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/f3c9561752f5bdb6b929b11d1e13b523.mp4?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In JollyRoll, the goal is simple: clear all the marbles before they reach the end of the track. Use your marble shooter to aim, match three of the same color, and watch them burst into pieces. Chain together combos, unleash powerful power-ups, and push for the highest score you can achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve mastered the basics, return to completed levels in a variety of challenge modes to test your skills and see how far you can go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/0f20b49993e2993aded11cae46738941.poster.avif?t=1757688021\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/0f20b49993e2993aded11cae46738941.webm?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/0f20b49993e2993aded11cae46738941.mp4?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/45d61ca5aed18732d6ea3c4cd029608c.poster.avif?t=1757688021\" width=256 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/45d61ca5aed18732d6ea3c4cd029608c.webm?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/45d61ca5aed18732d6ea3c4cd029608c.mp4?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you\u2019re not bursting marbles, you can explore\u00a0different toy-like zones, each with its own unique theme. Hidden throughout these areas are collectibles waiting to be found, and collecting them will unlock new parts of the game. Keep your eyes out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/2604b72c7e4d53587635a5ca387b58fe.poster.avif?t=1757688021\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/2604b72c7e4d53587635a5ca387b58fe.webm?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/2604b72c7e4d53587635a5ca387b58fe.mp4?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/7e0a3cda057c13ca28d371f7d4ae02b0.poster.avif?t=1757688021\" width=256 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/7e0a3cda057c13ca28d371f7d4ae02b0.webm?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/7e0a3cda057c13ca28d371f7d4ae02b0.mp4?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Over 100 handcrafted levels across a variety of themes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Challenge modes to put your skills to the test</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fun and strategic power-ups to help you score big</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Hidden collectibles to discover along the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A wide selection of marble skins to customize your game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Accessibility-friendly color settings for all players</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914160?t=1757688021","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914160?t=1757688021","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/125e61b5abe3e094af3aaa6a666eae48074ec6db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757688021","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/125e61b5abe3e094af3aaa6a666eae48074ec6db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757688021","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Opt