=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/0f20b49993e2993aded11cae46738941.webm?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/0f20b49993e2993aded11cae46738941.mp4?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/45d61ca5aed18732d6ea3c4cd029608c.poster.avif?t=1757688021\" width=256 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/45d61ca5aed18732d6ea3c4cd029608c.webm?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/45d61ca5aed18732d6ea3c4cd029608c.mp4?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you\u2019re not bursting marbles, you can explore\u00a0different toy-like zones, each with its own unique theme. Hidden throughout these areas are collectibles waiting to be found, and collecting them will unlock new parts of the game. Keep your eyes out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/2604b72c7e4d53587635a5ca387b58fe.poster.avif?t=1757688021\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/2604b72c7e4d53587635a5ca387b58fe.webm?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914160/extras/2604b72c7e4d53587635a5ca387b58fe.mp4?t=1757688021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p